      "writtenOn": "2023-01-06T01:11:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we want to use a big (48 MiB) pre-allocated buffer, I don\u0027t think I\u0027d change anything about the `WriteStringToFd` implementation, it doesn\u0027t have the same issue as reading.\n\nIf we want to use something more symmetric with the read side, we could do a loop that reuses a 4 KiB buffer. I\u0027ve added that to this CL. FWIW, it gets worse performance, at least with this buffer size.\n\nLet me know what you think.",
      "parentUuid": "ff228b1d_0066d81c",
